            "legal_notice": "© 2025 ARM Planetary Prospectors: Asteroid Resource Mining. All Rights Reserved by Nefarious Dimensions Inc.  <br />\r\nPurchasing ARM Planetary Prospectors on Steam unlocks an exclusive Early Access Membership with Nefarious Dimensions Inc. This isn’t just a game—it’s your ticket to shape a sci-fi epic. Your membership grants:  <br />\r\nAccess to the in-progress Episode 1, where your feedback refines the mining multiverse.  <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFirst dibs on the final ARM Planetary Prospectors release.  <br />\r\n<br />\r\nBonus Steam keys and Early Access to Episode 2 as a thank-you for joining us early.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEvery sale fuels our indie mission—improving gameplay, graphics, and voxel tech with your input. This is an experimental build, not a finished product—design, content, and features will evolve based on community collaboration. Post-launch updates and support may follow, but for now, you’re part of the journey.  <br />\r\nMembership Details:  <br />\r\nTied to your purchasing Steam account.  <br />\r\n<br />\r\nNo commercial license (that’s for the final release).  <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAll ownership and rights stay with Nefarious Dimensions Inc.—we’re 100% indie, no shareholders allowed.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLegal Note: Without our written consent, you may not copy, modify, reverse-engineer, or distribute this software. Let’s keep this adventure ours to build together!  <br />\r\n<br />\r\n",
